+    "hardness_basis": (
+        "Track B: fixed-nine meet-in-the-middle reciprocal subset search runs "
+        "in O(N^5) time and O(N^4) space; the shipping measurement is filled "
+        "from selftest, while the common-scale normalization takes under 100 "
