+        "Track B: fixed-eleven modular meet-in-the-middle reciprocal subset "
+        "search runs in O(N^6) time and O(N^5) space and, at shipping N=36, "
+        "succeeds in 8/8 trials after 1,884,966 modular additions and 2.936496 "
+        "seconds on average; the common-scale route takes 92 exact operations."
+    ),
+    "max_answer_tokens": 141,
+}
