+"""Verified problem generator for arXiv:1606.02117.
+
+The paper studies representations of one by distinct odd unit fractions and,
+in Lemma 2.5(a), gives a divisor-parametrised identity that preserves the odd
+denominator restriction.  This module uses that identity to plant an exact
+eleven-term representation inside a shuffled set of admissible denominators.
+The witness is known by composition of identities, never by solving the
+finished subset instance.
+"""
