Lemma 2.5(a) is the certificate-producing identity used here.  For P=2, q=2^t-1,
d|q, and distinct odd n_i with sum 1/n_i=2, it says

  1/q = 1/(q+2d) + sum_i 1/((q/d)(q+2d)n_i).

